# Spruce A at noon, in the forest from fir_set.py and on its own at LONE (48500,6383.1,500).
# The lone spruce's 18.47 m bounds, 67.5 degree vertical FOV and 1080 render lines give 99.6 and 49.8 px.
# For reference impostor stills, change the first `impostor off` to `impostor force`.
# Forest cameras follow perf-trees.bench from the rock hill through its 300 m view to about 400 m.
# Both `forest-300-*` samples hold the same view and switch only the representation.
# @timeout 360
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0

goto pos 43700 3000 500
clear 3000
deterministic on
impostor off
cam at 33500 7267 500 48500 7267 500
streaming wait
foliage wait-lull 1500 500
wait 1500
shot lone-100px
wait 200

cam at 18500 7267 500 48500 7267 500
streaming wait
foliage wait-lull 1500 500
wait 1500
shot lone-50px
wait 200
impostor auto
deterministic off

goto pos 42364 1700 -8973
clear 5000
cam at 48765 6679 -3156 54140 2490 -10780
streaming wait
grass wait
wait 5000
rec forest-fly
wait 500
cam fly 23216 11160 -8618 54140 2490 -10780 5500
wait 5500
cam fly 13140 13985 -7910 54140 2490 -10780 2500
wait 2500
wait 500
stop
wait 500

cam at 23216 11160 -8618 54140 2490 -10780
streaming wait
grass wait
wait 5000
cadence normal
impostor off
wait 1000
perf sample forest-300-off
wait 2000
perf stop
shot forest-300-off
wait 200
impostor auto
wait 1000
perf sample forest-300-on
wait 2000
perf stop
shot forest-300-on
wait 200
cadence wait
